# n in-place updates of a value held in an existential package, by code over its unknown type, n = 1000 and 4000: no copy per step (bytes linear)
# the offset covers a box per step (natively none for a pointer); a copy of the value per step is n^2/2 bytes or more
floats 1000 | floats 4000 | 4 8000
bytes 1000 | bytes 4000 | 4 8000
farr 1000 | farr 4000 | 4 8000
string 1000 | string 4000 | 4 8000
rows 1000 | rows 4000 | 4 8000
ref 1000 | ref 4000 | 4 8000
map 1000 | map 4000 | 4 8000
list 1000 | list 4000 | 4 8000
